{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Caravanners</strong> is an exploration and life adventure game set in a massive open world, focused on caravanning and a touch of camping. Start with an empty caravan and turn it into <strong>your dream mobile home</strong>, whether alone or with friends. Camp in the forests, go fishing, earn money by doing small jobs, and upgrade your caravan. Explore nature by day and enjoy music with your friends around the campfire by night. \ud83c\udfb5\ud83d\udd25<br>  <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/CARAVANNERS_Sr43r35t-02.png?t=1748092962\" /><br><br><br><br><strong>MAIN FEATURES:</strong><br>\ud83d\udd13 Huge open world - Total 1024 km\u00b2 (EA 400 km\u00b2)<br>\ud83c\udf04 Dynamic weather - Rain, fog, sun, snow<br>\ud83d\udc65 Play solo or with 1-4 players in co-op<br>\ud83c\udfaf Take on various jobs to earn money<br>\u2699\ufe0f Detailed caravan interior and exterior customization - Create your own style<br>\ud83c\udf14 Day-night cycle - Enjoy different vibes at different times<br>\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f Live the camper life with your caravan - Anywhere can be your home.<br>\ud83d\ude8c You can create a caravan convoy with your friends<br><br><br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/caravanners_school_2.gif?t=1748092962\" /><strong>\ud83d\udd3cTAKE THE DRIVING TEST - GET LICENSED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your ability to drive caravans depends on the points you earn in the driving test. Each caravan class requires a different license score. Be careful not to hit the cones!<br><br><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><br><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/CARAVANNERS_324R54.gif?t=1748092962\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> \ud83d\udd3c<strong>YOUR CARAVAN IS YOUR HOME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf72 Store your food in the fridge  <br>\ud83c\udf73 Cook meals and fill your belly  <br>\ud83d\udecb\ufe0f Sit on the couch, watch the outside, play music  <br>\ud83e\ude9f Open or close the curtains to set the mood  <br>\ud83d\udca1 Turn the lights on or off  <br>\ud83d\udecf\ufe0f Sleep in your bed and regain energy  <br>\ud83d\udebd Use the toilet in your caravan  <br>\u26fa\ufe0f Set up a camp area with modular tents around your caravan<br><br><br><br><br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/CARAVANNERS_CAMP_DESIGN.gif?t=1748092962\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd3c<strong>DESIGN &amp; BUILD YOUR OWN CAMP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your dream campsite from scratch alone or with your friends!  <br>With fully modular parts, design your ideal camp setup  <br>\ud83c\udf04 Whether by the lake or deep in the woods, anywhere can be your camp spot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\ude91 Set up your table and chairs  <br>\ud83d\udd25 Light the campfire  <br>\ud83c\udfb6 Play some music  <br>\ud83e\udd69 Cook your meat  <br>\ud83e\uddd8 Relax and chill with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the camp you\u2019ve designed with your own hands, true freedom awaits.  <br>What you do and how you live is entirely up to you! \ud83c\udf32\ud83d\udcab<br><br><br><br><br><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/CockpitDrive.gif?t=1748092962\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd3c\u00a0<strong>EXPLORE A MASSIVE OPEN WORLD - 1,024,000 m\u00b2 = 1024 km\u00b2</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lakes and seas you can swim in, forests, islands, villages, towns, mountains, secret places, small cities, different biomes  a vast world ready to be discovered!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Early Access starting map size: 400 km\u00b2 - Will expand to 1024 km\u00b2 with updates) <br> <br> <br><br><br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd3c\u00a0<strong>RESOURCE MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage hunger, thirst, sleep, toilet needs, fuel, food, money, points and more both personal and global resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><br><br><br>\ud83d\udd3d<strong>CUSTOMIZATION - DESIGN YOUR DREAM CARAVAN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/custommmdew3-02.png?t=1748092962\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/CARAVANNERS_EX_CUSTOM.gif?t=1748092962\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd3c\u00a0<strong>EXTERIOR CUSTOMIZATION - TUNING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paint choices for body, wheels, and bumpers  <br>Vehicle wraps - Skins  <br>Swap out bumpers  <br>Change wheels  <br>Pick your accessories  <br>Create your own style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><br><br><br> <br><br><br>  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/CARAVANNERS_FURNITURE.gif?t=1748092962\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd3cINTERIOR FURNISHING</strong>\u00a0- <strong>DESIGN YOUR LIVING SPACE</strong>  <br>Customize the interior walls, floors, and ceiling of your caravan  <br>Choose from wood, plain colors, and fabrics  <br>Select couches  <br>Cabinet styles  <br>Decor items  <br>Curtains and fabric options  <br>Add a fridge, grill, sink, toilet...   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br> <br><br><br><br> <br>   <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/caravanners_travel1.gif?t=1748092962\" /></p><h2 cla